WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.467
The lasting takeaway is a new axis for accelerating
diffusion models.

00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:08.025
Rather than sacrificing quality by taking fewer steps,

00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:12.110
ParaDiGMS spends parallel compute to run all the
steps faster,

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:16.723
cutting sampling latency by two to four times with
no loss in quality,

00:00:16.803 --> 00:00:20.545
and it composes with the fast samplers people already use.

00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:24.103
Looking forward, as parallel hardware keeps improving,

00:00:24.183 --> 00:00:29.111
sampling time will be limited only by the small
number of Picard iterations,

00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:32.340
pointing toward even faster real-time generation.
